# The coordinator waits a thousand times its Down bound before it re-places
# a down machine's roles: in practice it never re-places them. The heal
# oracle skips the whole check on a seed whose Down bound reaches past the
# tail, so this mutant asks whether anything else catches a cell that never
# heals on such a seed.
excuse: skip heal: re-place past tail
expect: survives #773
file: crates/lib/paros-coordinator/src/cell/watch.rs
--- find
            if now.saturating_sub(since) < self.replace_after {
--- replace
            if now.saturating_sub(since) < self.replace_after * 1000 {
--- end
